  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade Competitiveness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to increase trade competitiveness of member states.?Targeted, demand driven, and specialised technical assistance will be provided in the core thematic areas of export diversification, trade policy reform, e-commerce and digital trade advancement, and investment facilitation. The Secretariat will also provide support for the adoption of sustainable markets and circular economy principles.???</narrative>
  </description>
